    CM Plan Provision NOM Open API    ${delta_plan_name_vCU}_${timestamp}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    3x    10s    Check CM Parameter Value From NOM Actual Plan
    ...    ${integrated_ids_vCU}    MRBTS-11088/NRBTS-11085/NRCELL-1    administrativeState=Locked

    #vCU Provision Unlocked
    ${timestamp}    Generate Formatted Timestamp
    Set Test Variable    ${delta_plan_path_vCU}    ${TEST_LOG_DIRECTORY}/${delta_plan_name_vCU}_${timestamp}.xml
    ${PARAM_VALUE}    Set Variable    Unlocked
    ${file_content}    Get File    ${delta_plan_path_vCU_template}
    ${file_content}    Replace Variables    ${file_content}
    Create File    ${delta_plan_path_vCU}    ${file_content}
    CM Plan Import NOM Open API    ${delta_plan_path_vCU}    ${delta_plan_name_vCU}_${timestamp}
    CM Plan Download NOM Open API    ${delta_plan_name_vCU}_${timestamp}
    CM Plan Validate NOM Open API    ${delta_plan_name_vCU}_${timestamp}
    CM Plan Activate NOM Open API    ${delta_plan_name_vCU}_${timestamp}
    #CM Plan Provision NOM Open API    ${delta_plan_name_vCU}_${timestamp}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    3x    10s    Check CM Parameter Value From NOM Actual Plan
    ...    ${integrated_ids_vCU}    MRBTS-11088/NRBTS-11085/NRCELL-1    administrativeState=Unlocked

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    15x    20s    vDU Check All Cells Status Should Be Onair For All DUs     gnb_index=${0}

    [Teardown]    Case Postcondition

