*** Keywords ***
##########    common    ##########
Case Precondition
    [Arguments]    ${ReIntegrate_FHGW}=False     ${ReIntegrate_vCU}=False    ${ReIntegrate_vDU}=False
    log to console    Case Precondition
    Common Test Setup For AIC
    ${NEW_PLAN_NAME}   Get Test Case Name
    Set Test Variable  ${NEW_PLAN_NAME}
    Setup NOM
    Get FHGW Id

    #ReIntegrate NE
    ${timestamp}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_FHGW}    Generate Formatted Timestamp
    ${integrate_plan_path_FHGW}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_FHGW}    
    ...    Set Variable    ${plan_path}/FHGW-${FHGW_id}-integration-plan.xml
    ${integrate_plan_name_FHGW}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_FHGW}    Set Variable    FHGW-${FHGW_id}-integration-plan
    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_FHGW}    NOM Integrate NE    ${integrate_plan_path_FHGW}    ${integrate_plan_name_FHGW}_${timestamp}

    ${timestamp}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_vCU}    Generate Formatted Timestamp
    ${integrate_plan_path_vCU}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_vCU}    Set Variable    ${plan_path}/vCU-${vCU_id}-integration-plan.xml
    ${integrate_plan_name_vCU}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_vCU}    Set Variable    vCU-${vCU_id}-integration-plan
    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_vCU}    NOM Integrate NE    ${integrate_plan_path_vCU}    ${integrate_plan_name_vCU}_${timestamp}

    ${timestamp}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_vDU}    Generate Formatted Timestamp
    ${integrate_plan_path_vDU}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_vDU}    Set Variable    ${plan_path}/vDU-${vDU_id}-integration-plan.xml
    ${integrate_plan_name_vDU}    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_vDU}    Set Variable    vDU-${vDU_id}-integration-plan
    Run Keyword If    ${ReIntegrate_vDU}    NOM Integrate NE    ${integrate_plan_path_vDU}    ${integrate_plan_name_vDU}_${timestamp}

Case Postcondition
    log to console    Case Postcondition
    Common Test Teardown For AIC
    vDU Login By Rest
    Run Keyword And Ignore Error    vDU Logout By Rest
    Teardown NOM
